      "index": 0,
      "text": "We get four kinds of weather here. Two of them are summer.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "town",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Soldiers everywhere and not one of them will help carry groceries.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "town",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "The fruit is fine, the shipping is not, and the middlemen are the reason.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "town",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Traffic on the bridge is worse than the war, and I say that as a joke.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "town",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Half this town showed up from three different states to complain about one bridge.",
